o their best work.// Your ProfileExperience in building entire teams and processes from the ground up, optimally 3+ years experience in a fast-growing international tech companyFounder mentality and a strong passion for building organizations, structures and processes as well as heping others succeedHigh level of insight into human nature that helps in driving others to improve their performance and achieve their best in current and future roles.Profound understanding of all HR disciplines (e.g., sourcing and recruitment of tech and business talent, employee relations, talent and performance management, organizational development, HR strategy).Passion for the Demodesk vision and ability to pitch our story in a genuine way// Why usWell-funded and backed by Silicon Valley's top investors and angels, including Y Combinator, Kleiner Perkins and BaldertonFast-growing, diverse and international team of tech enthusiasts and entrepreneursUnique proprietary screen sharing technology using a demanding tech stackFull responsibility from day one and being part of our hierarchy-free and results-driven working environmentCompetitive salary plus attractive compensation packageFlexible working hours and annual travel allowance for working remotelyAttractive perks including gym memberships, German language course, top of the line MacBook or Linux machine, professional development budget of 1.500 € per yearRegular team events like dinners, Oktoberfest, ski trips and much more

